From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:07:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] perf(dashboards): spike the side panel on
 react-resizable-panels

SidePanelSplit puts the dashboard's side panel (Inspect, Add widget) on
react-resizable-panels 4.15.0 in place of SplitView. Around open and close
it freezes the grid at its whole-pixel width, lets the library move the
panels while CSS animates flex-grow, and releases once when the slide ends,
so each chart lays out once, after the slide. Drags commit on release
(resizePreviewMode="separator"). Focus moves into the panel on open and
back on close, as with SplitView.

Spike for review (docs/REVIEW/perf/README.md), not for main as it is.

